The tengwar and futhorc scripts are J.R.R. Tolkien's. This is a fan project,
unaffiliated with and unendorsed by the Tolkien Estate.

Tengwar Annatar (Johan Winge, 2005) is not redistributed here; install
ttf-tengwar-annatar from the AUR. Its licence permits redistribution only of
the complete original package, unmodified.

The source illustrations under wallpapers/ are included so that the plates can
be rebuilt from them, and are not covered by the MIT grant above.

The cursors under cursors/ are Blizzard Entertainment's World of Warcraft
artwork. They are not mine, are not covered by the MIT grant, and are not
licensed for redistribution. This repository is private for that reason. The
converter that builds them, forge/cursors.py, is MIT like the rest and works
with any folder of .ani or .cur files.
